      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Content Engine · Plan Post\nMon, Wed, Fri at 10:00 (or **Make One Now**) for every active row in `content_settings`:\n\n1. Reads recent posts so Claude does not repeat a topic. A client with 3+ drafts still waiting for the owner is skipped, so unanswered previews never pile up.\n2. Claude writes topic, caption (+ hashtags), image brief and alt text in the brand voice.\n3. Saves the draft to `content_posts` and calls **Render & Preview**, which draws the image and sends the owner the WhatsApp preview.",
